          "title": "You'll want to know: فاصلہ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "فاصلہ — fāslā — \"a distance\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "اسٹیشن سے ہوٹل کا فاصلہ کم ہے۔ isṭeshan se hoṭal kā fāslā kam hai. It isn't far from the station to the hotel."
            },
