          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "موڑنا — moṛnā — \"to turn (something); to bend\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ڈرائیور نے موڑ پر گاڑی بائیں موڑی۔ ḍrāivar ne moṛ par gāṛī bāeṅ moṛī. At the bend the driver turned the car to the left."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے سائیکل موڑی, us ne sāikil moṛī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "موڑنا (moṛnā) is inherited: CDIAL lists the Hindi cousin moṛnā, \"twists, bends\", under Sanskrit muṭati and its variant mōṭati (CDIAL 10186). مڑنا is its partner, to turn by yourself, and موڑ is the bend."
            }
          ]
        },
