              "text": "گھمانا — ghumānā — \"to show (someone) around; to turn round\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ایک دوست نے ہمیں شہر گھمایا۔ ek dost ne hameṅ shahr ghumāyā. A friend showed us round the city."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past, with نے (he or she …): اس نے چابی گھمائی, us ne chābī ghumāī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "گھمانا (ghumānā) is built on گھومنا, \"to go round\", which comes from ghummati, \"revolves\", a form CDIAL reconstructs (CDIAL 4485): it is the form for making something, or someone, go round."
            }
          ]
